            "body": "`MiniAnimateNormalFloat` highlight group is not a part of current version release (0.9.0), which this example installs (because of `version = \"*\"`). It is a [part of current `main` branch](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#minianimate) and will be a part of 0.10.0 release.\r\n\r\nChanging to `version = false`, updating plugins, and restarting Neovim should work as expected.",
